<!-- @format -->

• Mobile-first; Flex/Grid; html,body{overflow-x:hidden} (no horizontal scroll).
• Container/spacing: `.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}`, `.section{padding:56px 0}@media(min-width:1024px){.section{padding:80px 0}}`.
• Clamp typography scale for body/h1/h2/h3; readable first.
• Markdown prose: `.content[data-md]` with ~70ch width, nice spacing for p/ul/ol/blockquote.
• Sticky “glass” header; mega-panel with subtle animation; z-index correct; desktop hover open; mobile click.
• Dark mode: readable toggle/links; primary CTA text always white; good contrast.
• 3D cards `.tile3d` (shadow + subtle hover); avoid `!important`.
